<title>LATVIA: MULTIBANKA 1996 PROFIT UP, SEES HIGHER IN 1997.</title>
<headline>MULTIBANKA 1996 PROFIT UP, SEES HIGHER IN 1997.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Multibanka's 1996 profit rose to 153,000 lats in 1996 from 21,000 lats at the end of 1995, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the forecast profit for 1997 was 700,000 lats.</p>
<p>It also said that net interest income was 644,000 lats versus 439,000 lats, trade with securities and currencies brought profit of 593,000 lats versus 233,000 lats.</p>
<p>The bank's assets rose to 16.92 million lats from 9.69 million lats.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
